## 6. Success Metrics (MVP)

Measure:

| Metric | Use |
|--------|-----|
| **% successful x402 calls** | Proportion of x402_request calls that complete (200 after pay + retry). |
| **% denied calls** | Proportion denied (by policy: domain, budget, TTL). |
| **Avg approval time** | Time from proposal shown to user clicking Approve. |
| **User trust feedback** | Qualitative (e.g. survey): Do users feel in control? Trust the delegation model? |